            "review_title": "Review at Bep Sai Gon Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Kelly T\nBexley, Australia1 contribution\n0\nGreat everything but...\nMay 2019 • Family\nStopped in for pho and my little one wanted pizza. So got both as well as a delicious vermicelli and a few different drinks. Pizza was nice (no italian but pretty tastey) but Everything was else amazing and quite fast in terms of service.\n \nIf i had to fault them it was the initial service before entering the actual reaturaunt. The hostess was on her phone playing a game leaning on the menu as we were flipping through it. It wasn't until we actually went to walk in past her she prompt to the post. \nStill i would definitely eat here again dispite the meet n greet.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 1, 2019",
