            "review_title": "Review at Bep Sai Gon Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Siewhee H\n167 contributions\n0\nReasonable price and Delicious lobster\nFeb 2018 • Family\nLocated very near to the Nha Trang night market, it's a spacious restaurant with good food. Most prices are shown in the menu and wide selections available. Delicious seafood and lobster which we cant resist and ordered another one for take away. The reception lady knows simple English and Mandrin so it's not too difficult to communicate. \nProblem is the sound-proofing inside the restaurant is very bad, especially if there's a group of rowdy drunk customers. Also, the workers are too busy serving customers and don't have enough time to clean. Food quality also dropped a little if you visit late in the evening which is maybe due to fatigue on the workers.\nRead more\nWritten March 4, 2018",
