            "review_title": "Review at Bep Sai Gon Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Stewart\nFort Saskatchewan, Canada232 contributions\n0\nA place not to eat\nDec 2017 • Couples\nWent with another couple where I order seafood soup which was very good but small. In ordering squid for the four of us, we received 6 pieces. My wife ordered the ribs and was served 3 ribs about 2” long with just about no meat. Our friend ordered the duck and was served a leg which she couldn’t get her teeth into and her rice appeared to be old. This was shortly after the supper time so the food should have been fresh, we were obviously wrong. The bill was almost as much as the meal we had the day before for nine of us outside the tourist trap area. We left in discuss as no one spoke English to vent to!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 26, 2017",
